<title>USA: Leucadia to report gain on unit sale.</title>
<headline>Leucadia to report gain on unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leucadia National Corp said it will report a pre-tax gain of about $300 million on the sale of its Colonia Penn Life Insurance Co and Providential Life Insurance Co units upon completion of the transaction.</p>
<p>Leucadia said it has agreed to sell Colonial Penn, Providential and certain related Assets to Conseco Inc for $460 million in cash and notes.</p>
</text>
